<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Food Recipe</title>

    <style>
        body {
            font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
            background-color: #fff3e0;
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
        }

        .container {
            max-width: 800px;
            margin: 40px auto;
            background: white;
            padding: 30px;
            border-radius: 15px;
            box-shadow: 0 5px 20px rgba(0,0,0,0.2);
        }

        h1 {
            text-align: center;
            color: #e65100;
        }

        h2 {
            color: #f57c00;
            border-bottom: 2px solid #ffcc80;
            padding-bottom: 5px;
        }

        .food-image {
            width: 100%;
            max-height: 350px;
            object-fit: cover;
            border-radius: 12px;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
        }

        li {
            margin: 10px 0;
        }

        .steps li {
            margin-bottom: 15px;
        }

        .info {
            background-color: #fff8e1;
            padding: 15px;
            border-radius: 10px;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
        }
    </style>
</head>

<body>

    <div class="container">

        <h1>🍝 Vegetable Pasta Recipe</h1>

        <div class="info">
            <strong>Cooking Time:</strong> 30 minutes <br>
            <strong>Servings:</strong> 2 people
        </div>

        <h2>🥕 Ingredients</h2>

        <ul>
            <li>200g pasta</li>
            <li>1 tablespoon olive oil</li>
            <li>1 onion, chopped</li>
            <li>2 cloves garlic, chopped</li>
            <li>1 tomato, chopped</li>
            <li>1/2 cup bell peppers</li>
            <li>1/2 cup sweet corn</li>
            <li>1/2 teaspoon black pepper</li>
            <li>1/2 teaspoon chili flakes</li>
            <li>Salt to taste</li>
            <li>1/2 cup pasta sauce</li>
            <li>Grated cheese for topping</li>
        </ul>

        <h2>👨‍🍳 Cooking Instructions</h2>

        <ol class="steps">
            <li>Boil water in a large pot and add a little salt.</li>

            <li>Add the pasta and cook according to the package instructions.</li>

            <li>Heat olive oil in a pan and sauté the chopped onion and garlic.</li>

            <li>Add tomato, bell peppers, and sweet corn. Cook for 5–7 minutes.</li>

            <li>Add pasta sauce, black pepper, chili flakes, and salt.</li>

            <li>Add the cooked pasta and mix everything together.</li>

            <li>Cook for another 2–3 minutes.</li>

            <li>Top with grated cheese and serve hot.</li>
        </ol>

        <h2>🍽️ Serving</h2>

        <p>
            Serve the vegetable pasta hot with extra cheese and your favorite
            drink. Enjoy your delicious homemade meal!
        </p>

    </div>

</body>
</html>
